    "detailed_description": "Make ikayaki (grilled squid) on the Steam!<br>Fire up your hot plate and cook a bunch of ikayaki!<br>You can play with up to four players!<br>A new high score is just within your reach!<br><br><br>Cook ikayaki on your hot plate!<br>Earn points based on how well your ikayaki are cooked!<br>Make as many as you can before time runs out!<br><br><br>1. Cook the surface a little, then make a cut!<br><br>2. Cook the other side a little, then put the skewer in!<br><br>3. Once the surface has cooked well, cover it in sauce!<br><br>4. Once the other side has cooked too, pack it up and you're done!<br><br>[Score Attack]<br>Make lots of ikayaki to increase your score and climb the rankings!<br><br>[Battle]<br>Test your ikayaki-making skills in a cooking competition!",
    "about_the_game": "Make ikayaki (grilled squid) on the Steam!<br>Fire up your hot plate and cook a bunch of ikayaki!<br>You can play with up to four players!<br>A new high score is just within your reach!<br><br><br>Cook ikayaki on your hot plate!<br>Earn points based on how well your ikayaki are cooked!<br>Make as many as you can before time runs out!<br><br><br>1. Cook the surface a little, then make a cut!<br><br>2. Cook the other side a little, then put the skewer in!<br><br>3. Once the surface has cooked well, cover it in sauce!<br><br>4. Once the other side has cooked too, pack it up and you're done!<br><br>[Score Attack]<br>Make lots of ikayaki to increase your score and climb the rankings!<br><br>[Battle]<br>Test your ikayaki-making skills in a cooking competition!",
    "short_description": "It's time for a street-food-making challenge: ikayaki! Make as many as you can and watch your food cart prosper!",
